fd112f81c9")) (text "CPU POWER - DRAFT. Not a complete or release-qualified power system." (at 15 211.0 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left)) (uuid "443c8911-eb88-5af1-a8af-9344bd3582fd")) (text "RK860-0: I2C address 0x40, DIE_ID=0x8, default 1.000 V, 12.5 mV step. No substitution with -2/-3." (at 15 216.08 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left)) (uuid "bc8ba9ec-771d-56fe-aba8-d793eda07fc3")) (text "CPU_FB_SENSE is the regulator feedback net, NOT an RK3562 ball. RK860 p4 specifies sensing at the output capacitor." (at 15 221.16 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left)) (uuid "af9f154d-68ae-501c-8c96-81644404b87c")) (text "R1001 and C1020 bridge VDD_CPU to CPU_FB_SENSE; C1020 is NOT a feedback-to-ground capacitor." (at 15 226.24 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left)) (uuid "96c85771-ec26-5a04-92cb-c9b8f95c40e6")) (text "Input +5V_MAIN must be current-qualified and inrush-limited. +3V3_PMU enables CPU at the PMIC stage." (at 15 231.32 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left)) (uuid "e9d43492-9c47-5d6a-ab66-a95ff11432ce")) (text "Add 4 x 22uF at the SoC CPU balls: total nominal CPU output capacitance becomes 176uF." (at 15 236.4 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left)) (uuid "6b790d9e-9c3a-5793-aaaf-de5977a603f8")) (text "Effective capacitance must exceed the vendor requirement after tolerance, bias and temperature; MPNs pending." (at 15 241.48 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left)) (uuid "1f6dd6ad-5c8d-53ec-aeba-714285cb9dd1")) (text "Inductor candidate must pass Isat/Irms, ripple and thermal review; catalog current alone is insufficient." (at 15 246.56 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left)) (uuid "c8875650-298c-5d80-b696-28e5a641235c")) (text "I2C pull-ups and PMIC_SLEEP bias belong to the PMIC/SoC circuit; do not add duplicate pull-ups here." (at 15 251.64 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left)) (uuid "6ddd9cec-8626-542f-b319-0d442c038ee3")) (text "RK860 Rev1.2 p4 supports capacitor-side sensing. RC inherited from RK3568; loop stability/values remain unqualified for RK3562." (at 15 256.72 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left)) (uuid "c567b52d-4240-55f2-96ae-3d1fda9fb8f7")))
